  "body": "Welcome to a home that's been at the heart of one family's story for the past 45 years.\r\n\r\nLovingly owned and cherished by the same family since the late 1970s, this remarkable character home has seen children grow up, lifelong memories made, and generations gather. Set on prestigious Stanley Point Road with stunning water views, it's easy to see why they never wanted to leave.\r\n\r\nOriginally built in 1911, this beautiful weatherboard home spans approximately 300 square metres across three generous levels, offering an incredible sense of space and adventure. It's the kind of home where children can race from floor to floor, discover secret hideaways like the under-stair cupboard affectionately known as 'The Harry Potter' and create the same unforgettable childhood memories that have filled these walls for decades.\r\n\r\nThe layout has been thoughtfully designed for growing families. Upstairs, you'll find the generous master bedroom alongside two additional bedrooms and a family bathroom, creating the perfect family zone. Downstairs, the fourth bedroom enjoys its own ensuite, offering exceptional flexibility for extended family, overnight guests, an au pair, teenagers seeking independence, a peaceful work-from-home office, or even a quiet therapy or\r\nconsulting room.\r\n\r\nPracticality is just as impressive, with an internal access garage, a family-sized laundry, and an abundance of storage ensuring there's a place for everything as your family grows.\r\n\r\nSunlight pours into every level, while ever-changing water views provide a stunning backdrop from almost every room. With decks on two levels, you'll be spoiled for choice when deciding where to enjoy your morning coffee, entertain friends, or simply sit back and watch the views come alive, even swans of late.\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle here is just as special as the home itself. Launch a kayak or paddleboard, enjoy an afternoon swim, or spend weekends at the nearby parks, tennis club, petanque and playing fields. Families will also appreciate being just a short stroll from the highly regarded Stanley Bay Primary School, making school runs effortless.\r\n\r\nRich in character, filled with history, and perfectly positioned in one of Devonport's sought-after neighbourhoods, this is more than just a house—it's a place where another family can begin their own story for generations to come.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the warmth, space, and lifestyle that have made this home so special for the past 45 years. It may just be the place where your family's next chapter begins.",
